HOW TO READ IT
  The vote earns its place only if "vote (m>=1)" beats the better of always-follow /
  always-fade on the SAME touches. If it merely beats the coin flip, that is the
  geometry, not the signal. If "anti-vote" wins, the vote is backwards.
  If "NO GATE vote-dir" matches "vote (m>=1)", the margin gate only shrinks the sample.
  Margin 1/2/3 should order monotonically if margin is really conviction.

